0..77 Comment "// An arm that hands its recursive call to another definition, unfolded at an"
78..153 Comment "// open argument: the call is stuck at the argument\'s variable, and the arm"
154..227 Comment "// goes on into the other definition\'s call over it. Each step states one"
228..304 Comment "// unfolding of the recursion as a path, as an arm that returns constructors"
305..380 Comment "// over its call converts (`nested-call-sugar.gandr`). Structural recursion"
381..455 Comment "// unfolds only at a constructor (Abel, _Termination checking with types_,"
456..484 Comment "// doi:10.1051/ita:2004015)."
486..528 Comment "// The naturals the recursion takes apart."
